<view class="page"><view class="heading"><text class="title">说出想法，一起成稿</text><text class="sub">AI 每次问一个问题，陪你找到自己的故事</text></view>
<scroll-view scroll-y class="conversation" scroll-into-view="{{scrollTo}}"><view class="welcome" wx:if="{{!messages.length}}">你想让听众记住什么？不用组织好语言，先说一件你想分享的事。</view><view id="msg-{{index}}" class="message {{item.role}}" wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="index"><text class="who">{{item.role === 'user' ? '我' : '演讲教练'}}</text><text selectable>{{item.content}}</text></view><view class="sources" wx:if="{{sources.length}}">参考资料：<text wx:for="{{sources}}" wx:key="*this">《{{item}}》 </text></view><text wx:if="{{busy}}">正在处理，请稍候…</text></scroll-view>
<view class="composer"><button class="voice" bindtap="onRecord" disabled="{{busy || starting}}">{{recording ? '结束录音，识别文字' : starting ? '正在启动录音…' : '点击说话（每段60秒）'}}</button><textarea value="{{input}}" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="识别后的文字会出现在这里，确认后发送；也可直接输入" maxlength="4000"/><button bindtap="send" disabled="{{busy || recording || starting || !input}}">发送给教练</button><view class="actions"><button bindtap="draft" disabled="{{busy || recording || starting || !messages.length}}">整理成稿</button><button bindtap="fresh" disabled="{{busy || recording || starting}}">新对话</button></view><text class="notice">发送内容将交由 AI 处理。AI 内容请核对后使用。</text></view></view>